# Play finds a game's launchers among the menu entries (Walnut's own, one per mode, are there)
Recommends: ps3-games-integration
Description: Walnut Games, the games database and launcher
 A window with a card for every game in the Walnut Games catalog: its medal and scores from the
 tests on the PS3, screenshots next to the PC's, known issues and the patches Walnut made. Install,
 Remove and Play (through ps3-game, so game mode applies). The catalog is the one packaged with this
 version, so the app works offline; https://walnut.nanobyte.dev/gamedb/ is always current.
 Installing and removing go through walnut-games-helper (sudoers: group sudo, no password), which
 only knows the catalog's games, never removes anything but the game's own packages, and never
 runs autoremove.
